WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.925
Select the intended guardian. Verify the guardian’s identity and relationship. Do not give one guardian another person’s account.

00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:33.083
Enter the verified contact details. Correct only the fields supported by the family’s approved information. This example changes a synthetic email.

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:43.811
Review contact and portal choices. Billing contact and Parent portal login have different effects. Changing a contact is not permission to change access.

00:00:43.811 --> 00:00:55.603
Review before saving. In normal use, save once only with authorization, wait for confirmation, then reopen the record. This demonstration stops before saving.

